# Project: Smart Personal Finance & Money Management System

Act as a Senior Full-Stack Software Architect, Financial Application Developer, Database Architect, and UI/UX Designer.

I want you to build a complete, production-quality, responsive Personal Finance Management Website that helps me manage my money effectively, track every transaction, control spending, manage credit cards and bank accounts, monitor investments, and plan my financial future.

This should not be a basic expense tracker. It should be an intelligent personal finance management system with accurate financial calculations and logical transaction handling.

Build the complete working application, including frontend, backend, database, authentication, financial calculations, notifications, and email reminders.

